's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"f0901c35a81a7462887b6e26ef2750e3","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"eb35b0a60cb12580219205a9f62fe5d1","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6354f01696b3cf47614e5a1990ebc457","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"73029765fee6b855bebdabf449bfeda2","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"3b738de7383f16df0cf1ed4348212da6","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"4c2916b52b8202762d7b1bd796cdf68f","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"ca096eb66781c92b5fafb859fc4f19a5","originalFileName":"6a1038ba-20d2-4f68-8316-e82d00c6d0da-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"9652fec1